 "title": "N.S. Ramaswamy Pre-doctoral Fellowship (NSR Pre-doc) | IIM Bangalore",
 "text": "DURATION\nOne-year, Fulltime programme\n \n2026\n09 students enrolled\nOverview\n\nThe N. S. Ramaswamy Pre-doctoral Fellowship (NSR Pre-doc), launched in 2018, is a one-of-its-kind programme, which helps participants prepare for a prestigious doctoral degree.\n\nThe programme is specially designed around the needs of doctoral-level students and helps them navigate the process of applying for a doctoral degree. Once they have successfully completed the programme at IIMB, they are equipped to take tests and interviews in prestigious universities where their research areas match.\n\nDownload Brochure\n\nMission\n\nNSR Pre-doc, with a focus on inclusion, has been instituted with the aim of increasing the social diversity of management academia in India. The one-year apprenticeship programme is designed to help pre-doctoral fellows successfully apply to doctoral programmes in management and allied disciplines. \n\nWhat’s in it for you\n\nMentoring by internationally acclaimed faculty, the opportunity to engage with both current and former Ph. D scholars, expert guidance in writing research proposals, 100 percent financial support and the experience of student life in a Pritzker-prize winning campus are among the reasons you should choose the programme.\n\nThe programme will help you develop a research topic, understand data collection methods and plan a viable proposal for your doctorate, explore key skills required for doctoral study, become familiar with key terminology, develop your written and spoken critical thinking, and understand your subject specialization.\n\nProgramme Requirements\n\nEach fellow is assigned a mentor who is a full-time faculty member at IIMB. \n\nFellows need to attend the Ph. D preparatory programme\nEach fellow has to complete at least two doctoral or MBA-level three-credit courses in their areas of interest and approved by the faculty mentor\nFellows need to work for a minimum of 40 hours per week under the supervision of the faculty mentor\nA math clinic (one and a half hours per week) and a writing workshop (one and a half hours per week) are required, except when waived by the faculty mentor and approved by the Pre-doctoral faculty committee\nAreas\n\nThe 2025-26 N. S. Ramaswamy Pre-doctoral Fellowship is available in the following disciplinary areas within management scholarship and research:\n\nDecision Sciences\nEconomics\nEntrepreneurship\nFinance & Accounting\nInformation Systems\nMarketing\nOrganizational Behaviour & Human Resources Management\nProduction & Operations Management\nPublic Policy\nStrategy\nCertificate of Completion\n\nUpon successful completion of the programme requirements, a Certificate of Completion is issued to the students.\n\nFirst Batch of the Programme\n\nDuring the year 2018-2019, seven students enrolled for the programme – one each in the areas of Economics & Social Sciences, Entrepreneurship, Finance & Accounting, Information Systems, Marketing, Organizational Behaviour & Human Resources Management, and Public Policy. The first batch of seven students, a group of five male and two female participants with work experience in different sectors and in diverse profiles including that of Principal Researcher, Data Entry Operator, Implementation Executive, and Business Development Manager, completed the programme and received their certificates on 27 March 2019.\n\nNSR Pre-doc in the News\n8th cohort of NSR Pre-doc successfully concludes one-year fellowship at IIM Bangalore\nN.S. Ramaswamy Pre-doctoral Fellowship welcomes 12 fellows in the 8th cohort at IIMB\nNSR Pre-doc fellow Muhammed Sadiq becomes programme’s first PhD graduate\n7th cohort of NSR Pre-doc concludes fellowship at IIM Bangalore on 1 May 2025\nHow to Apply\n\nThe online application form for admission to NSR-Predoc 2025-26 is available at\nhttps://campus.iimb.ac.in/psp/cssisprd/?cmd=login&languageCd=ENG&\n\n\nThe deadline for submission of fully completed applications is 7 February 2025 (5:00 p.m.). Please note that candidates can apply to a maximum of two areas of specialization.\n\nAdmission Process and Eligibility Criteria\n\nClick here for details: Pre-Doc-admission-process-2026.pdf\n\nFor queries, email: predocadm[at]iimb[dot]ac[dot]in, Tel: +91 80 26993013/3017\n\nContact\n\nAdmissions Office\n\nIndian Institute of Management Bangalore\nBannerghatta Road\nBengaluru - 560 076\n\n+91- 80 - 26993013 / 3017\n\n predocadm[at]iimb[dot]ac[dot]in\n\nNSR Pre-doc Programme Office\n\nIndian Institute of Management Bangalore\nBannerghatta Road\nBengaluru - 560 076\n\n+91- 80 - 26993480\n\npredocoffc[at]iimb[dot]ac[dot]in",
